---
// TechCapability.astro (Jasa Website Development)
---

<section class="capability-section" id="capability">
  <div class="cap-container">
    
    <div class="section-header animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
      <div class="header-eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot">●</span> SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE
      </div>
      <h2 class="header-title">Membangun Website dari Interface hingga Business Logic</h2>
      <p class="header-intro">
        Kami merancang arsitektur sistem web secara menyeluruh, memastikan setiap lapisan (layer) bekerja harmonis demi stabilitas dan keamanan jangka panjang.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-layout">
      
      <!-- Left side: Vertical visual stack representation -->
      <div class="cap-visual animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 250ms;">
        <div class="stack-container">
          <div class="stack-layer layer-user">
            <span class="layer-num">1</span>
            <span class="layer-title">USER LAYER</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="stack-layer layer-front">
            <span class="layer-num">2</span>
            <span class="layer-title">FRONTEND INTERFACE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="stack-layer layer-logic">
            <span class="layer-num">3</span>
            <span class="layer-title">BUSINESS LOGIC ENGINE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="stack-layer layer-back">
            <span class="layer-num">4</span>
            <span class="layer-title">API / BACKEND LAYER</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="stack-layer layer-db">
            <span class="layer-num">5</span>
            <span class="layer-title">DATABASE STORE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="stack-layer layer-int">
            <span class="layer-num">6</span>
            <span class="layer-title">INTEGRATIONS LAYER</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right side: Explanation cards -->
      <div class="cap-details">
        
        <div class="detail-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 300ms;">
          <h3 class="detail-title">1. Frontend (User Interface)</h3>
          <p class="detail-desc">Antarmuka visual responsif yang diakses pengguna langsung melalui web browser. Dirancang dengan UI/UX modern, cepat dimuat, dan mudah dinavigasi di perangkat apapun.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 400ms;">
          <h3 class="detail-title">2. Business Logic</h3>
          <p class="detail-desc">Otak dari website Anda. Menentukan aturan, alur kerja, validasi, dan bagaimana data diolah sebelum diproses lebih lanjut.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 500ms;">
          <h3 class="detail-title">3. Backend & API</h3>
          <p class="detail-desc">Sisi server yang mengamankan pengolahan data utama, menangani otentikasi pengguna, logika berat, dan bertindak sebagai jembatan komunikasi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 600ms;">
          <h3 class="detail-title">4. Database</h3>
          <p class="detail-desc">Penyimpanan terstruktur untuk semua informasi penting seperti data pengguna, pesanan, konten, atau log transaksi secara aman dan cepat diakses.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 700ms;">
          <h3 class="detail-title">5. Integrations</h3>
          <p class="detail-desc">Lapisan komunikasi dengan aplikasi eksternal (third-party services) seperti payment gateway, CRM, logistik, atau WhatsApp API.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .capability-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cap-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-dot {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-size: 8px;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .header-intro {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #7D96C5;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .cap-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Visual stack styling */
  .cap-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .stack-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
    background: rgba(13, 20, 34, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 30px;
  }

  .stack-layer {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .layer-num {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .layer-user { background: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.1); border-color: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.2); color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .layer-user .layer-num { background: var(--accent-blue); color: #ffffff; }

  .layer-front { background: rgba(57, 213, 232, 0.1); border-color: rgba(57, 213, 232, 0.2); color: #39d5e8; }
  .layer-front .layer-num { background: #39d5e8; color: #0f172a; }

  .layer-logic { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); color: #8b5cf6; }
  .layer-logic .layer-num { background: #8b5cf6; color: #ffffff; }

  .layer-back { background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.1); border-color: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2); color: #ec4899; }
  .layer-back .layer-num { background: #ec4899; color: #ffffff; }

  .layer-db { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #10b981; }
  .layer-db .layer-num { background: #10b981; color: #ffffff; }

  .layer-int { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #f59e0b; }
  .layer-int .layer-num { background: #f59e0b; color: #0f172a; }

  .stack-arrow {
    color: var(--border-color);
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 4px 0;
  }

  /* Details Panel */
  .cap-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .detail-card {
    background: rgba(13, 20, 34, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .detail-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .detail-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }

  .detail-desc {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #7D96C5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Animations */
  .animate-fade-scroll {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(15px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Light Theme */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .capability-section {
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-intro {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .stack-container {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .detail-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .detail-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .detail-desc {
    color: #64748B;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .cap-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .cap-visual {
      order: 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .capability-section {
      padding: 60px 16px;
    }
    
    .header-title {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>
